<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
	
	<!-- EN: fading psycho comedown -->
	<Crashed.stages.fading_psycho_comedown.label>惊魂粉反噬消退</Crashed.stages.fading_psycho_comedown.label>
	<!-- EN: Ugh. My head is pounding, but at least I can think straight again. -->
	<Crashed.stages.fading_psycho_comedown.description>呃，头痛得厉害，但至少又能正常思考了。</Crashed.stages.fading_psycho_comedown.description>
	<!-- EN: major psycho comedown -->
	<Crashed.stages.major_psycho_comedown.label>严重惊魂粉反噬</Crashed.stages.major_psycho_comedown.label>
	<!-- EN: I feel awful. My mind feels sluggish and I can barely keep my balance. -->
	<Crashed.stages.major_psycho_comedown.description>太难受了。脑子迟钝得要命，连平衡都快保持不住了。</Crashed.stages.major_psycho_comedown.description>
	<!-- EN: initial psycho comedown -->
	<Crashed.stages.initial_psycho_comedown.label>惊魂粉反噬初现</Crashed.stages.initial_psycho_comedown.label>
	<!-- EN: I don't feel so good. My vision is blurry and my hands are starting to shake. -->
	<Crashed.stages.initial_psycho_comedown.description>感觉不太对。视线模糊，双手也开始发抖。</Crashed.stages.initial_psycho_comedown.description>
	
	<!-- EN: coming down from psycho -->
	<PsychoHigh.stages.coming_down_from_psycho.label>惊魂粉药效消退</PsychoHigh.stages.coming_down_from_psycho.label>
	<!-- EN: Things are slowing down and my head is starting to pound. -->
	<PsychoHigh.stages.coming_down_from_psycho.description>周围的一切都慢了下来，我的头也开始剧痛。</PsychoHigh.stages.coming_down_from_psycho.description>
	<!-- EN: fading psycho high -->
	<PsychoHigh.stages.fading_psycho_high.label>惊魂粉亢奋消退</PsychoHigh.stages.fading_psycho_high.label>
	<!-- EN: I still feel so good. -->
	<PsychoHigh.stages.fading_psycho_high.description>感觉还是棒极了。</PsychoHigh.stages.fading_psycho_high.description>
	<!-- EN: psycho high -->
	<PsychoHigh.stages.psycho_high.label>惊魂粉亢奋</PsychoHigh.stages.psycho_high.label>
	<!-- EN: I feel powerful and ready for anything. -->
	<PsychoHigh.stages.psycho_high.description>我感觉充满力量，已经准备好应对一切。</PsychoHigh.stages.psycho_high.description>
	
</LanguageData>
